{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53776","headline":"行香子（清凉山文殊赞） · 白居易","name":"行香子（清凉山文殊赞）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文殊菩萨，出化清凉，神通力以（一作「应」）现他方。\n真（一作「身」）座金毛师子，微放珠光。\n衆生仰持宝盖，绝名香。\n我今发愿，虔诚归命，不求富贵，不恋荣华。\n愿当来世，生（一作无「世」、「生」二字，下同）净土，法王家。\n愿当来世，生净土，法王家。\n（见日本长惠编《鱼山诗钞》，注「一作」者，爲《声明古调》本之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}